          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kako mbuboobu mbwaamba Mwami Jehova wamakamu. Nobantu bangu mukede mu-Ziyoni, mutayoowi mu-Asuri, nekuba kuti wakuumya inkoli akukunyampwida musako mbubonya mbuli ziyanza zyaba-Egepita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.11.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 11:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kwasyaala kaindi kaniini loko, elyo bukali bwangu buyoomana, lunyemo lwangu luyooleka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova wamakamu uyoomubusizya mitatula, mbubonya mbwaakacita ciindi eciya ba-Midyani nibakazundwa kundomba ya-Orebi. Musako wakwe uyooba ajulu lyalwizi, uyoousumpula mbubonya mbwaakacitila ba-Egepita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.105.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Int 105:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo mubuzuba obo mukuli wakwe uyoogwisigwa amakuko aako, alyalo ijoko lyakwe liyoozwa kunsingo yako, Ijoko liyoonyonyooka nkaambo kakunanikwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
